{
 "version": 1,
 "src": "CardTitle_eng.gmd (the MAIN pool 0..0x234 = the words, the SUB pool from 0x264 = the connectors) and CardEdit_eng.gmd (the unlock texts), arranged as the game's own title menu reads them; build_guild_titles.py (C:\\MH3U-Extract), notes/armor.md \"Guild Card titles\"",
 "dropped": "DUMMY / HARDUMMY slots (560-564 in the DLC range), and the (None) head of each pool, shipped as noneReq. CardTitle ids 0x235.. (\"Trooper\" .. \"Capcom\") are never listed by the game (0x45bc44 stops at 0x234) and are left out.",
 "order": "the game's order: word id ascending, connector id ascending (0x45bc44, 0x45bd24)",
 "pages": "eight slots to a page (0x45b7f0: cursor slots 6..13). The menu lists only words the save has unlocked (0x99880c), so a page number from this table is an upper bound for a real card.",
 "note": "Available from the start.",
 "noneReq": "Available from the start.",
 "colo": "a word with `colo` is written in the game's text with that <COLO n> colour (the HR 999 word); the COLO palette is not read, so the colour itself is not shipped",
